{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4thシングル制服のマネキンの時からショートヘアになって、早2年？3年？ですね‥久しぶりにロングになりました‥‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンっ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうかなぁ？＞_＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロングヘアー久しぶり過ぎて‥(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショートがいい！って方が多かったですね～(^^)\n沢山のコメントありがとうございます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木のの！や！のぎ天！乃木どこ！NOGIBINGO！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山乾燥くれて嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだモバメをしてないのでモバメっぽく\nコメントをくれてる方の名前と返事を書いていくね～だから読んでると何の返事が本人しかわからないんだけど‥汗(^^;;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やってると だんだん全員に返事が書きたくなるんだね～笑笑\n全員は出来なかったんだけど‥涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ～始めるけ～見てね～(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.12  つーじーさんへ\nＯＫ～(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.25 必殺技さんへ\nヤッタ～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.49 ゆーゆちゃんへ\nそんなことないよ～  でも嬉しい～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.64 はーるさんへ\n皆だね‥(^^;; 教えてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.80 マルチーズちゃちゃまるさんへ\nうん！がんばる～見ていてね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.98 みささんへ\nその気持ちが嬉しいです\nまた会いに来てください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.105 ちなつさんへ\n中3は受験だね～頑張って！私も一緒に頑張る‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.115 バンバンきいちゃん推しさんへ\n本当に来てよ～待ってるよ～(^o^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.127 もえりんさんへ\n来てくれてありがとう  どうだったかな～？\nまた会いに来てね～(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.133 みっさーさんへ\n参加してもいいよ～笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.140 佑キング（京都人）さんへ\nおめでとうございます～(^O^)\n素敵な1年になりますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.157 まーさんへ\nd(^_^o)O.Ｋ～\nコメント待ってるね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.166 ゆーた広島ブルースさんへ\nいつも応援ありがとうございます。\n広島でも早くイベントがしたいです\nこれからも応援してくださ～い(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.173 馬仮面さんへ\nうん！ゴマ団子好き～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.183 げんちゃんへ\nここー！！笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.224 乃木坂ファンの1人さんへ\n身体は大丈夫ですか？\nいつもありがとうございます。\nまた待ってま～す！(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.247 アビスパさんへ\n海流の島よ\n私、起きる\n‥う～ん沢山ある～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.251 あすたむさんへ\n明日多夢さんの明日も明日多夢でありますように\nいつもありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.257 ズキスさんへ\n本当にいい曲ばかりだから迷う～\nそう言ってもらえると嬉しいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.267 塗り塗り魔人さんへ\nえー！凄い～見た～い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.293 あんどろめ～だ（こっこちゃん）へ\nプリクラ見たいな～笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.313 こぞさんへ\nコメントは本当に嬉しいんです\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.325 すずきちさんへ\n照（≧∇≦）よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.333 まさき桃さんへ\n電車で寝過ごした事はないけど、反対方向に行ってた事はあるよ～笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.352 たっちんさんへ\nまあやもその歌好き～(^O^)\nありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.368 わたぼうさんへ\nO.Ｋ～まかせといて～笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.400 もみまんさんへ\nきてくれるの～ありがとう\n待ってるね～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NO.407 英Zさんへ\nえ～照\nありがとう～^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好評だったらまたするね～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気っ子ショートコンビだよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも まあやのことを思ってくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も皆んなが健康で笑顔でありますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眠くなったから寝るね～^o^\nおやすみ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/11/11/9796166/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"}],"source":"archive"}